> * When exactly does your God gift you for #offers??  I have had characters
> that offered dozens of  fresh corpses and nothing other then 'a hopefull

Your explevel must be higher than 2, luck must be non-negative and 
rn2(10 + (2 * u.ugifts * nartifacts)) must return zero. (Here nartifacts
is the number of artifacts already in the game and u.ugifts is the number
of gifts your god has already given to you.
Oh, and of course the god must not be angry with you.
There's also u.ublesscnt that must be zero. It is increased for example
when you receive a gift or and decreased with every sacrifice when it is
positive. 
So, you have just had bad luck with the RNG.
The hopeful feeling means that u.ublesscnt was positive and got decreased.

